/* v1.13.4 更新日志 */
"新增批量重命名（默认关闭）：多选后支持查找替换、前后缀、序号、日期与大小写规则，可实时预览、提示冲突并撤销" = "Added Batch Rename (off by default): rename multiple items by find & replace, prefix/suffix, numbering, date, or letter case with live preview, conflict checks, and undo";
"优化应用内自动更新下载：放宽首字节超时并新增双源慢启动竞速下载，诊断信息同步补充更新失败原因" = "Improved in-app update downloads with a longer first-byte timeout, dual-source slow-start racing, and update failure details in diagnostics";
"优化设置简洁模式切换动画与扩展状态异步检测，深色模式与语言改用分段选择器且仅在语言实际变化时重启" = "Improved Compact Mode transition animations and async extension status checks, switched appearance and language to segmented pickers, and avoided unnecessary relaunches when the active language is unchanged";
"修复剪贴板历史收起详情时未恢复展开前尺寸，以及深色模式下详情图标置灰的问题" = "Fixed Clipboard History not restoring its previous window size when collapsing details, and fixed the details icon appearing muted in Dark Mode";

/* v1.13.3 更新日志 */
"新增瞬时快照截图方式：支持全屏定格框选、颜色画笔标注与撤销，可直接复制或保存到常用目录" = "Added instant snapshot capture mode with full-screen selection, color brush annotation and undo, and quick copy or saving to favorite folders";
"剪贴板默认跳过系统「密码」应用（含菜单栏小组件）及带敏感、临时标记的内容，可在设置中按需开启记录" = "Clipboard history now skips Apple Passwords (including the menu bar extra) and sensitive or transient items by default, with an optional toggle in Settings";
"全局快捷键支持单独设置 F1–F12 功能键，并升级二选一胶囊选择器与全局下拉框样式" = "Added standalone F1–F12 function key support for global shortcuts and upgraded binary switches and dropdowns across Settings";
"优化 Git 远端分支状态展示与拉取、推送反馈；右键「服务」菜单改为默认关闭" = "Improved Git remote branch status display and fetch/pull/push feedback; right-click Services menu items are now off by default";

/* v1.13.2 更新日志 */
"新增轻量剪贴板历史（默认开启）：在本机保留最近 5–20 条文本、图片与文件，支持退出保留、详情预览、文件拖入与拖出" = "Added lightweight clipboard history (on by default): keeps the last 5–20 text, image, and file items locally across restarts with detail preview and drag in/out";
"新增可选快速截图入口（默认关闭）：支持通过状态栏菜单或全局快捷键快速唤起系统原生截图" = "Added optional Quick Screenshot shortcut (off by default) to open the native Screenshot panel from the menu bar or a global shortcut";
"状态栏菜单同步显示剪贴板与截图的自定义快捷键，并精简菜单项文案" = "Displayed custom clipboard and screenshot shortcuts in the menu bar and simplified menu item titles";

/* v1.13.1 更新日志 */
"减少 macOS「服务」菜单中只读复制与剪切操作的冗余确认弹窗，触发更流畅" = "Removed redundant confirmation prompts for read-only copy and cut actions in macOS Services for a smoother workflow";
"简化粘贴队列与配置读写流程，提升多文件粘贴与日常操作响应速度" = "Simplified cut-queue and configuration persistence to speed up multi-file pasting and everyday actions";
"清理多项冗余逻辑并收拢工具窗口位置记忆与弹窗交互，进一步降低内存与磁盘占用" = "Cleaned up redundant code and unified tool window frame persistence and dialog presentation";

